    <p class="subtitle">Comprehensive trend analysis of monthly crude oil prices spanning over five decades. Prepared for energy market analysts, macroeconomic researchers, and commodity strategists.</p>
    <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top:4px;">Dataset: {n} monthly observations &middot; {fmt_date(first_date)} – {fmt_date(last_date)} &middot; Nominal USD/bbl</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="container">

<!-- ── SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW ───────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="executive-overview">
  <h2>1. Executive Overview</h2>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card">
